      ## Actions

      ***Ram.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Ram]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+4,dicelabel=Damage [Ram]) Bludgeoning damage plus rollable(dice=2d4,dicelabel=Damage [Ram]) Radiant damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature and the elk moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra rollable(dice=2d4,dicelabel=Damage [Ram]) Bludgeoning damage and has the ***Prone*** condition.

